Comment:
 Archimet's web interface, logger, gateway, rules and tooling. This package contains no Kismet
 code: it depends on the official Kismet packages (kismet-core, kismet-capture-linux-wifi,
 kismet-capture-linux-bluetooth), installed from the Kismet project's signed repository.
 Kismet is by Mike Kershaw (Dragorn) and contributors, GPL-2.

